WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:04.700
You two could never possibly
understand how I feel.

00:04.700 --> 00:11.330
True, I don't think your anger and pain are
things we could easily understand.

00:13.610 --> 00:16.080
God is awakening.

00:19.610 --> 00:21.740
So, you finally show yourself.

00:22.820 --> 00:30.560
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

00:30.560 --> 00:37.520
Tooku tooi basho e to

00:50.880 --> 00:57.090
Kaze ni fukare aruite yuku

00:57.090 --> 01:04.050
Umarekita imi o shiritakute

01:04.260 --> 01:10.570
Tatoeba ushinau toki ga kitemo

01:10.570 --> 01:17.700
Dakishimeru koto ima, erabou

01:20.140 --> 01:27.550
Bokutachi wa mina kitto te o nobashiterun da

01:27.550 --> 01:33.520
Nakusenai mono ni mukatte

01:33.520 --> 01:41.160
Kagayaita yume dake o taguriyosenagara

01:41.160 --> 01:48.030
Tooku tooi basho e to

01:56.040 --> 02:00.070
Episode 18
The Prayer That Will Not Fade

02:05.490 --> 02:07.490
H..He's huge!

02:07.490 --> 02:08.890
Is he a spirit?

02:08.890 --> 02:10.690
But whose?

02:14.160 --> 02:17.130
Th..They're so eerie...

02:18.470 --> 02:20.090
Shut up!

02:25.370 --> 02:27.000
Stay away!

02:41.120 --> 02:43.060
Don't you run!

02:43.060 --> 02:45.690
Anyone who runs away, I'll kill!

02:56.100 --> 03:01.080
I see, so they were defying us
because they had this thing.

03:01.080 --> 03:04.370
What an insolent bunch of worms!

03:14.420 --> 03:17.130
Is that a spirit?

03:17.130 --> 03:18.930
If it is...

03:18.930 --> 03:21.050
...just whose is it?!

03:24.730 --> 03:26.970
Damn it, coming at me in droves...

03:26.970 --> 03:28.770
There's no end to them!

03:31.110 --> 03:35.240
I never imagined there was a spirit in Kalb-Hu.

03:36.310 --> 03:40.440
I see, so he fooled us all,
not even telling me about it.

03:41.320 --> 03:44.250
Kemp, this is brilliant.

03:44.250 --> 03:48.210
With a force like this added to our side,
we still have a chance to win.

03:54.130 --> 03:56.260
Just you wait, Hugh!

03:59.830 --> 04:03.630
Did these people summon that spirit, then?

04:04.270 --> 04:07.400
O, God... O, savage God...

04:22.360 --> 04:24.150
What power!

04:31.700 --> 04:33.830
How could Zakua be taken down?!

04:34.940 --> 04:36.900
This is impossible!

04:39.870 --> 04:43.310
It is the collective unconscious of the entire race

04:43.310 --> 04:46.280
which summons and uses that spirit.

04:46.780 --> 04:49.420
I shall settle things with this spirit.

04:49.420 --> 04:51.210
That's Pronimo.

04:52.020 --> 04:56.650
Pronimo here has an interesting
connection to that spirit.

04:57.590 --> 05:00.560
I shall present it to you now.

05:27.860 --> 05:29.220
What's going on?!

05:29.220 --> 05:32.760
Isn't that spirit supposed to protect Kalb-Hu?!

05:32.760 --> 05:36.030
That spirit is our god.

05:36.030 --> 05:38.830
It is an existence which merely
watches over the people.

05:38.830 --> 05:41.500
But once awakened,

05:41.500 --> 05:44.740
it moves according to its own divine logic!

05:44.740 --> 05:47.980
But aren't you the ones who summoned it?!

05:47.980 --> 05:51.100
It's yours, the Kalb-Hu spirit, right?!

05:53.510 --> 05:58.140
Seeing it now, can you not tell the
reason we call it " God" ?

06:03.420 --> 06:07.360
This is why I didn't want to awaken God.

06:07.360 --> 06:08.930
What should we do?

06:08.930 --> 06:10.930
How can we stop it?

06:10.930 --> 06:13.270
I know! If I use my spirit...

06:13.270 --> 06:14.900
You shouldn't !

06:14.900 --> 06:18.030
Our god is incredibly strong and great.

06:18.610 --> 06:20.230
But...

06:22.910 --> 06:24.080
Roya!

06:24.080 --> 06:26.210
It's no use, come back!

06:28.620 --> 06:33.990
At this rate, I'll end up like them, lured by God.

06:33.990 --> 06:36.960
I must not lose control now.

06:46.770 --> 06:52.570
I... I must stop our god...

07:04.650 --> 07:07.020
Is this all right with you, Hugh?

07:07.020 --> 07:10.560
I wonder what you meant by
"interesting connection" ?

07:10.560 --> 07:12.860
You will understand soon.

07:21.470 --> 07:23.270
It's over?

07:23.700 --> 07:25.330
No...

07:25.940 --> 07:27.910
This is just fine.

08:16.390 --> 08:21.900
Long ago, as a condition of the armistice
between Zymot and Kalb-Hu,

08:21.900 --> 08:27.270
we took this great spirit, Pronimo, from Kalb-Hu.

08:27.270 --> 08:30.840
However, she was not complete.

08:30.840 --> 08:34.240
This is Pronimo's true form.

08:34.240 --> 08:37.540
I see, so that was the secret.

08:42.480 --> 08:45.610
I'm glad I didn't make an enemy of you.

08:46.750 --> 08:51.390
At last, I have the first key spirit.

08:51.390 --> 08:55.020
So, getting that thing was
your goal all along, eh?

08:55.530 --> 08:57.570
Honestly, the tricks you pull...

08:57.570 --> 08:59.130
You're in a category all your own.

08:59.130 --> 09:01.600
I'm grateful to you, Elmeida.

09:01.600 --> 09:04.710
I owe this to your violence.

09:04.710 --> 09:06.310
Thank you for waiting.

09:06.310 --> 09:09.280
I would think staying here any longer
would merely bore us.

09:10.380 --> 09:12.480
Elmeida, I leave the rest to you.

09:12.480 --> 09:14.110
Fine...

09:14.680 --> 09:17.480
By the way, are you finished
with the little miss, then?

09:18.650 --> 09:20.450
" Little miss" ?

09:21.590 --> 09:23.560
Never mind!

09:32.070 --> 09:34.030
I'm going on ahead, Rambos!

09:40.610 --> 09:42.240
Hugh...

09:52.790 --> 09:54.460
Rebecca!

09:54.460 --> 09:56.290
Rebecca, what's with you?

09:56.290 --> 09:58.090
Pull yourself together!

09:59.230 --> 10:01.690
I've found you, Hugh!

10:06.030 --> 10:07.540
I'll kill you.

10:07.540 --> 10:09.330
I'll kill you!

10:10.870 --> 10:12.040
Rebecca!

10:12.040 --> 10:15.340
Don't let a single one of them
escape, got that?

10:15.340 --> 10:17.910
You can kill any who resist!

10:17.910 --> 10:19.710
Stop, Rebecca!

10:22.950 --> 10:24.920
You jerks are in my way!

10:26.420 --> 10:28.220
I'll kill you.

10:32.330 --> 10:35.500
My, my, aren't we in a hurry?

10:35.500 --> 10:36.630
Move aside!

10:36.630 --> 10:38.770
Where do you think you're going?

10:38.770 --> 10:40.470
I told you to move!

10:40.470 --> 10:42.840
If it's to see Hugh, forget it; it's pointless.

10:42.840 --> 10:44.630
After all...

10:47.270 --> 10:51.310
Hugh doesn't even remember you anymore.

10:51.310 --> 10:52.980
Move!

10:52.980 --> 10:54.850
To think you hate him so much,

10:54.850 --> 10:57.650
but you can't even get his attention!

11:01.690 --> 11:03.490
I feel sorry for you,

11:04.330 --> 11:06.290
so I'll put you out of your misery!

11:13.400 --> 11:15.030
My, my...

11:29.850 --> 11:31.590
Kemp...

11:31.590 --> 11:36.550
Pr..Princess Rebecca, I am sorry.

11:37.320 --> 11:40.530
I have destroyed both my ears,

11:40.530 --> 11:44.160
and I can no longer hear your voice.

11:45.170 --> 11:49.630
So, please forgive me for speaking
to you one-sidedly.

11:50.400 --> 11:52.370
I don't have the time for that!

11:54.040 --> 11:55.040
Unhand me!

11:55.040 --> 11:56.980
Princess Rebecca,

11:56.980 --> 12:01.940
I met you once when you were very young.

12:05.450 --> 12:09.080
It was when I was still ten years old.

12:10.320 --> 12:15.790
It was the first time I had an audience with King
Bakkam, as the companion of our village leader.

12:16.630 --> 12:21.590
We Kalb-Hu were an oppressed
people, of course.

12:22.640 --> 12:24.260
Take that!

12:26.010 --> 12:27.840
What's wrong, brat?

12:27.840 --> 12:30.110
There's no need to be nervous.

12:30.110 --> 12:32.240
Relax, relax!

12:35.020 --> 12:37.120
Then, I leave it to you.

12:37.120 --> 12:40.090
Yes, your majesty, we shall do as you ask.

12:42.660 --> 12:44.620
Princess Rebecca, no!

12:45.760 --> 12:48.460
You mustn't touch someone like him.

12:48.460 --> 12:50.160
Neat!

12:50.160 --> 12:52.400
He's different from me!

12:52.400 --> 12:53.400
Princess!

12:53.400 --> 12:56.370
It's fine, let her do as she pleases.

12:57.140 --> 13:02.380
This lets the people of Kalb-Hu
breathe underwater.

13:02.380 --> 13:03.840
Really?

13:03.840 --> 13:06.640
Wow, I'm jealous!

13:07.520 --> 13:08.320
Boy...

13:08.320 --> 13:09.880
Y..Yes, your majesty!
Boy...

13:09.880 --> 13:15.060
Zymot and Kalb-Hu are sister nations
which have sworn to coexist.

13:15.060 --> 13:19.130
If either were gone, this land
would not be as it should.

13:19.130 --> 13:21.830
I look forward to cooperating with you.

13:21.830 --> 13:25.630
Y..Your words are too great an honor!

13:27.430 --> 13:32.390
Your gaze was unaffected by appearances
or prejudice, it was dazzling.

13:35.110 --> 13:40.150
And when I heard that you were the one
who had saved Guzma and the others

13:40.150 --> 13:42.270
from the underworld training ground,

13:43.150 --> 13:46.120
I thought, " One day, I must repay her kindness. "

13:47.720 --> 13:50.690
That wish was soon granted, but...

13:52.360 --> 13:57.330
Being able to see you again made
me even happier than that did,

13:57.330 --> 14:01.630
even if you had turned into someone
possessed by the lust for revenge.

14:06.310 --> 14:07.930
Kemp...

14:08.540 --> 14:10.880
You are a free woman now.

14:10.880 --> 14:15.340
Please stop devoting your efforts to
such a petty thing as revenge!

14:16.450 --> 14:18.350
How can you say such a thing?!

14:18.350 --> 14:22.480
We Zymotans have stolen even your god!

14:23.060 --> 14:27.190
A smile suits you far better.

14:39.570 --> 14:43.780
Man, he just kept prattling on.

14:43.780 --> 14:46.410
What an absolute pain in the rear.

14:48.980 --> 14:53.320
I finally understand what it is I should do.

14:53.320 --> 14:56.120
Huh? What are you talking about?

14:56.120 --> 15:00.080
I wasn't living.

15:02.760 --> 15:04.730
Rebecca, where are you?!

15:08.340 --> 15:09.800
That's ...

15:09.800 --> 15:11.540
That bastard Hugh!

15:11.540 --> 15:13.670
Hold it right there, Hugh!

15:17.140 --> 15:18.940
That boy...

15:19.510 --> 15:22.550
Could I ask you to wait for me a few moments?

15:22.550 --> 15:26.350
I have to give my greetings to that shard caster.

15:30.390 --> 15:36.160
Who would have thought you were the
one who defeated Glaudio?

15:36.160 --> 15:38.770
Hugh, I'm going to take you down!

15:38.770 --> 15:39.970
Oh, ho!

15:39.970 --> 15:42.600
Well then, show me your power.

15:44.970 --> 15:46.770
What is this?

15:48.880 --> 15:49.880
What's that?

15:49.880 --> 15:51.850
Hey, look at that light!

15:58.250 --> 16:01.050
What is that spirit?

16:02.320 --> 16:05.590
A..Amir Gaul...

16:05.590 --> 16:09.390
To think a kid like this was wielding it...

16:13.430 --> 16:14.440
What's going on?

16:14.440 --> 16:16.230
What happened?

16:19.310 --> 16:22.180
Where did you get that key spirit?

16:22.180 --> 16:25.110
What the heck is a " key spirit" ?

16:25.110 --> 16:29.080
You don't even know what you have?!

16:29.080 --> 16:30.880
Shut up!

16:35.690 --> 16:40.150
To think you've had Amir Gaul and
not even known about key spirits!

16:41.430 --> 16:42.860
What do you mean?

16:42.860 --> 16:44.930
What's a key spirit?!

16:44.930 --> 16:48.500
If you want to know, become a citizen of Zymot.

16:48.500 --> 16:50.400
If you do that, I'll tell you.

16:50.400 --> 16:52.110
Get real!

16:52.110 --> 16:54.070
As if I'd join you!

17:00.410 --> 17:03.820
What is that energy emanating
from the two spirits?

17:03.820 --> 17:05.790
It is nothing ordinary.

17:06.520 --> 17:09.150
Who is that boy?

17:14.090 --> 17:16.560
Are you all right, Lady Despara?

17:19.630 --> 17:21.430
An enemy?

17:23.370 --> 17:26.000
Ro..Roya...

17:48.260 --> 17:49.800
Are you all right?

17:49.800 --> 17:53.430
Don't worry, it is just one of my episodes.

17:53.430 --> 17:55.400
But how maddening...

17:55.400 --> 17:57.530
What is this pain?

18:25.700 --> 18:27.330
Stop!

18:28.970 --> 18:31.640
Drop your sword, Rebecca.

18:31.640 --> 18:34.070
Princess Rebecca, you mustn't do as she says!

18:34.070 --> 18:36.200
Come on, hurry up and drop it!

18:39.010 --> 18:40.110
Rebecca!

18:40.110 --> 18:42.150
Don't move!

18:42.150 --> 18:44.620
If you move, she dies.

18:45.890 --> 18:47.850
Now, come on!

18:50.290 --> 18:52.090
Just do it.

18:52.960 --> 18:55.130
You can kill me.

18:55.130 --> 18:57.800
In return, let Lucia go.

18:57.800 --> 18:59.430
Rebecca!

18:59.430 --> 19:01.730
Princess Rebecca, no!

19:08.640 --> 19:14.150
The princess of Zymot says she'll die
in place of a Kalb-Hu worm?

19:14.150 --> 19:16.020
How lovely.

19:16.020 --> 19:18.820
What a lovely story!

19:18.820 --> 19:22.060
But you know, I hate stories like that.

19:22.060 --> 19:25.510
I always prefer tragic endings!

19:26.390 --> 19:28.190
Die!

19:34.230 --> 19:35.570
Princess Rebecca!

19:35.570 --> 19:36.900
Rebecca!

19:36.900 --> 19:38.530
Lucia!

19:44.410 --> 19:47.380
I didn't get to deliver a
finishing blow, but oh well.

19:49.250 --> 19:51.050
Time to withdraw!

20:12.370 --> 20:14.440
I see...

20:14.440 --> 20:17.710
So, this is all it can do against Amir Gaul.

20:17.710 --> 20:19.280
Amir Gaul...

20:19.280 --> 20:21.050
Boy!

20:21.050 --> 20:23.880
You showed me something good today.

20:23.880 --> 20:26.490
I look forward to the next time we meet.

20:26.490 --> 20:27.650
You're going to run away?!

20:27.650 --> 20:29.280
Zed!

20:30.660 --> 20:32.830
Hold it right there, you bastard!

20:32.830 --> 20:34.630
Zed!

20:34.630 --> 20:37.260
Rebecca is... Rebecca is...

20:52.810 --> 20:55.780
I'm sorry, Rebecca.

20:55.780 --> 20:58.350
Hugh got away.

20:58.350 --> 21:02.220
Don't worry about it.

21:02.220 --> 21:08.860
I found freedom at last...

21:10.500 --> 21:12.830
Stay with us, Rebecca!

21:12.830 --> 21:13.830
Rebecca?

21:13.830 --> 21:16.600
Listen, Roya...

21:16.600 --> 21:21.510
Up until now, I was a nation's princess,

21:21.510 --> 21:25.080
or the emblem of a rebellion...

21:25.080 --> 21:28.520
I didn't properly live as either.

21:28.520 --> 21:31.080
I just passively played the parts,

21:31.080 --> 21:36.720
but now I can finally be true to my feelings.

21:36.720 --> 21:41.520
So, I'm very happy right now.

21:46.670 --> 21:52.300
Princess Rebecca, this child's life
was saved thanks to you.

21:53.910 --> 21:56.980
She's a healthy girl.

21:56.980 --> 21:58.950
I'm glad...

22:02.520 --> 22:04.850
Zed...

22:04.850 --> 22:05.850
Roya...

22:05.850 --> 22:07.150
What?

22:07.150 --> 22:08.950
Thank you.

22:09.760 --> 22:13.560
I'm so glad I got to...

22:15.000 --> 22:17.620
...meet you...

22:19.470 --> 22:21.090
Rebecca?

22:21.400 --> 22:23.200
Rebecca?!

22:23.200 --> 22:25.800
REBECCA!

22:41.920 --> 22:44.520
Kazashita te hiraite

22:44.520 --> 22:47.360
Ano taiyou ni yararesou sa

22:47.360 --> 22:52.320
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tokashite ikou

22:52.670 --> 22:58.310
Atsui jacket nugisute hashiridashita
n da, dakara 6, 7, 8

22:58.310 --> 23:04.270
Nai kaze fukasete ima tobidashite, go!

23:09.320 --> 23:14.720
Yuriokosareta heddo okinuke
ni todoku taiyoukou

23:14.720 --> 23:18.520
Yume o hanatsu ameagari

23:20.230 --> 23:22.960
Kono michi o tobashite

23:22.960 --> 23:30.430
Ichido-kiri no ima to kodou o sagashite

23:31.100 --> 23:33.770
Tsukanda te tsukidase

23:33.770 --> 23:36.540
Ano taiyou mo kowasesou sa

23:36.540 --> 23:41.500
Yuuutsu na omoi wa sora ni tobashite ikou

23:42.020 --> 23:47.550
Try again fumidase tameratte
iru no naraba 7, 8, 9

23:47.550 --> 23:53.690
Ten made hibikaseru kono koe dashite, go!

24:16.920 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
A Dark Land

24:18.080 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "A Dark Land"
